# xschem reads its rc from the current directory, so opening this bench
# directly from tb/ needs one here, otherwise the DUT symbol does not resolve
# and the instance is dropped from the netlist without a warning.
#
# chipify never reads this file: it runs xschem with the project root as the
# working directory, where the real xschemrc lives. Sourcing that one keeps the
# two paths identical instead of duplicating the library setup.
source [file normalize [file join [file dirname [info script]] ../xschemrc]]
